WEBVTT

00:07:58.030 --> 00:08:00.797
and banking conglomerate
that launched one of

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:06.230
the world's largest health platforms with
pinyon good doctor in terms of user

00:08:06.230 --> 00:08:08.363
base. Now, the question is, of course,

00:08:08.763 --> 00:08:14.063
why are there so few examples of
established companies creating these

00:08:14.063 --> 00:08:18.263
disruptive ventures? It's very simple.
It's their success.

00:08:18.697 --> 00:08:20.497
As an established company,

00:08:20.497 --> 00:08:24.497
you usually focus on managing your
existing business models.

00:08:24.763 --> 00:08:26.863
You get better and better at it,

00:08:27.163 --> 00:08:31.297
and you develop antibodies that kill
anything that looks differently.